# Croatian idiom: a bare genitive-plural "dana" (of days) trailing a
# year/month/week count is the emphatic filler "godinu/mjesec/tjedan DANA"
# (literally "a year/month/week OF DAYS" == exactly one year/month/week),
# never a genuine extra day -- a standalone "+1 day" reads the nominative
# "dan", not this genitive-plural form.  Institut za hrvatski jezik /
# Hrvatski jezični portal, sklonidba imenice "dan": genitiv množine "dana".
# https://hjp.znanje.hr/
dana
